			full = "The Earthen Ring is based at Camp Gev'rek, atop Skywatcher Plateau in northwestern Mulgore, and Muln Earthfury, the leader of the Ring, keeps his place here. The Ring has recently allied with the Windshapers, the shaman leaders of the skyborne elves of Zephras Isle, and brought them into the Horde. Skyborne who call themselves shen'dorei work in the camp beside tauren shaman, druids and a priest of An'she.\n\nThe elder farseer Nuara Tremorhoof says the ebb and flow of magic has been disrupted of late, and that even the mages of Dalaran are perplexed. Whether the trouble is arcane or the elements themselves are in unrest, no one here can yet say.",
			source = "",
