			full = "Wolves, kodo, tallstriders and cougars share the grass of the Rolling Plains, which cover much of southern Mulgore and run from Bloodhoof Village to the border of the Barrens. Centaur outriders wander the open fields. A nest of Windfury harpies sits in the eastern part.",
			source = "https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Rolling_Plains",
